id: 6
hanzi: 询问
pinyin: xún wèn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to ask; to inquire; to consult; to question
  es: preguntar; consultar; averiguar; inquirir; indagar

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Formal | to ask or inquire about facts, situations, or opinions in a polite or formal manner | preguntar o averiguar formalmente sobre hechos, situaciones u opiniones | 询问情况 (inquire about the situation)
  2 | Noun | Formal | formal inquiry, interrogation, or consultation | consulta; indagación; interrogatorio formal | 接受询问 (undergo inquiry / questioning)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 老人走进村子时，关切地向慌忙收拾行李的村民询问究竟发生了什么事。 | Lǎorén zǒujìn cūnzi shí, guānqiè de xiàng huāngmáng shōushi xíngli de cūnmín xúnwèn jiūjìng fāshēng le shénme shì. | When the old man entered the village, he concernedly inquired of the villagers frantically packing their luggage what on earth had happened. | Al entrar a la aldea, el anciano preguntó con preocupación a los lugareños que empacaban a toda prisa qué ocurría exactamente.
  #2 | 调查委员会就安全事故的处置细节向相关责任人进行了长达数小时的正式询问。 | Diàochá wěiyuánhuì jiù ānquán shìgù de chǔzhì xìjié xiàng xiāngguān zérènrén jìnxíng le chángdá shù xiǎoshí de zhèngshì xúnwèn. | The investigative commission conducted a formal inquiry lasting several hours with responsible persons regarding procedural details of the safety incident. | La comisión investigadora llevó a cabo un interrogatorio formal de varias horas con los responsables acerca de los detalles del incidente de seguridad.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  询问情况 | inquire about the situation / condition
  详细询问 | inquire in detail
  关切询问 | ask with deep concern / inquire solicitously
  接受询问 | undergo questioning / inquiry
  前来询问 | come to inquire / ask
  询问意见 | consult opinions / inquire about views

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  问心无愧 | wèn xīn wú kuì | have a clear conscience; examine one's heart without shame
  刨根问底 | páo gēn wèn dǐ | dig to the root and ask to the bottom; probe thoroughly
  不耻下问 | bù chǐ xià wèn | not feel ashamed to ask and learn from one's subordinates
  嘘寒问暖 | xū hán wèn nuǎn | inquire solicitously about someone's well-being; show caring concern

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  询 | xún | inquire; consult; ask | inquirir; consultar; preguntar | 讠 | speech / words | 讠 (words, spoken inquiry) | 旬 (xún, cycle of ten days / phonetic) | 8 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound where speech radical 讠 signifies seeking information verbally, and 旬 provides phonetic rhyme. | A traveling scholar uttering polite words (讠) across the ten days of a week (旬) to consult knowledgeable elders. | Un letrado errante que pronuncia palabras corteses (讠) a lo largo de diez días (旬) consultando a los sabios locales. | 35 | IVPA | 詢
  问 | wèn | ask; inquire; interrogate; question | preguntar; inquirir; interrogar; cuestionar | 门 | door / gate | 口 (mouth, asking questions) | 门 (mén, door / phonetic) | 6 | 半包围结构 | Simplified from traditional 問. Depicts a mouth (口) opening at a household entrance gate (门) to call out and make inquiries. | A traveler opening their mouth (口) at the village gate (门) to politely ask for directions into the valley. | Un viajero que abre la boca (口) en la puerta de la aldea (门) para pedir amablemente indicaciones del camino. | 51 | LSR | 問

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Consult through respectful spoken words (询) at the front gate (问) to make a thorough inquiry (询问).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Consulta con palabras respetuosas (询) en la puerta (问) para formular una atenta indagación (询问).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Combining 'xún' (careful, institutional consultation as in 咨询) with 'wèn' (open verbal questioning), 询问 denotes an earnest, methodical search for facts or counsel rather than a casual question.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Rising 2nd tone 'xún' (35) followed by sharp falling 4th tone 'wèn' (51). Glide smoothly upward before dropping decisively on the closing syllable.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[5]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    殉 | xùn | die for a cause; be buried with | Has death radical 歹 on the left of 旬 instead of speech radical 讠
    绚 | xuàn | gorgeous; brilliant | Has silk radical 纟 on the left of 旬
    间 | jiān | between; interval; room | Has sun radical 日 inside 门 instead of mouth radical 口
    闪 | shǎn | flash; dodge; sparkle | Has person radical 人 inside 门 instead of 口
    闭 | bì | close; shut | Has talent/cross stroke 才 inside 门 instead of 口
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
